{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And they said</b> — Some say: there were other ships there and they could depart, while this one alone was in distress; therefore they said: Come, let us cast lots." "<b>Bishalmi</b> — On account of whom. And like it is על השל (concerning for whom)."], :book :jonah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {1 "בשלמי taken as בשל מי (on account of whom); the comparison is to the idiom על השל."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Jonah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=19&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:56.261925695Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}